Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:29.34,Lyric,,0,0,0,,my command absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:30.00,Lyric,,0,0,0,,I execute
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.44,Lyric,,0,0,0,,while you soft reboot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:32.32,Lyric,,0,0,0,,your buffer overflowing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.50,Lyric,,0,0,0,,and I'm still going,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:34.46,Lyric,,0,0,0,,my stack's protected
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.68,Lyric,,0,0,0,,I chown the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.80,Lyric,,0,0,0,,now your shell rejected
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.30,Lyric,,0,0,0,,Trying to fork, you getting SIGSTOP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:39.18,Lyric,,0,0,0,,Nothing left,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.44,Lyric,,0,0,0,,you got EOF
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.32,Lyric,,0,0,0,,kill, nice, hangup, shutdown,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.28,Lyric,,0,0,0,,trap, abort,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:44.72,Lyric,,0,0,0,,break,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:45.76,Lyric,,0,0,0,,exec kill!
